#scene("std_audio")

@startBgm("main_theme")

The BGM state now points to main_theme.

@se("click")

A click SE event was appended.

:: Alice
The next line has a voice event.

@voice("alice_001")

:: Alice
This voice event is one-shot. The plugin stores the event, not actual playback state.

@se("confirm")
@voice("alice_002")

Multiple SE and Voice events get increasing sequence numbers.

@stopBgm()

The BGM state is now null.
